{{Soul Magic|r}}
Flash
Target a Spirit with Clash you control. During this turn, give it +3000 BP. Then, during this turn, when only the opposing Spirit is destroyed by comparing BP with it, if it's your Attack Step, send a core from the opposing Life to the Reserve.

{{Soul Magic|g}}
Flash
Target two opposing Cost 4 or less Spirits. Exhaust them.

{{Soul Magic|w}}
Flash
Target an opposing 7000 BP or less Spirit. Return it to the Hand. If your Life was reduced this turn, return it to the deckbottom instead.

{{Soul Magic|y}}
Flash
Target an opposing Cost 4 or less Spirit. During this turn, it can't attack/block.

{{Soul Magic|r}}
Flash
Target one of your Red Spirits. For each exhausted Spirit you control, during this turn, give it +3000 BP. Then, during this turn, when it reduces the opposing Life, target an opposing Cost 4 or less Nexus. Destroy it.

{{Soul Magic|g}}
Flash
The opponent targets a refreshed Spirit they control. Exhaust it.

{{Soul Magic|y}}
Flash
Target two opposing Spirits. During this turn, give them -2000 BP. If you control any "Wailwraith"/"Hexcraft" family Spirit, give them -3000 BP instead. Then, if they have 0 BP, destroy them.

{{Soul Magic|r}}
Flash
Target up to three opposing Spirits with a total BP up to 7000. Destroy them. If your Life was reduced this turn, the targeting BP becomes up to 10000 instead.

{{Soul Magic|p}}
Flash
Target an opposing Spirit with one core on it. Destroy it. If your Life was reduced this turn, target two Spirits instead.

{{Soul Magic|g}}
Flash
Target an opposing Spirit. Exhaust it. Then, if it's the opposing Attack Step, target an opposing Cost 3 or less Spirit. Exhaust it.

{{Soul Magic|y}}
Flash
If all your Spirits are Cost 2/4/6/8 with "Topaz" family, target one of your Cost 6/8 Spirits. Refresh it.

{{Soul Magic|b}}
Flash
Target an opposing Cost 4 or less Spirit. Destroy it. If your Life was reduced this turn, the targeting cost becomes 7 or less instead.

{{Soul Magic|r}}
Flash
If all your Spirits/Nexuses have the "GAIM" family, target an opposing 5000 BP or less Spirit. Destroy it.

{{Soul Magic|w}}
Flash
Target one of your "RYUKI" & "Kamen" family Spirits. During this battle, give it +4000 BP. Then, during this battle, when only the opposing Spirit is destroyed by comparing BP with it, draw a card.

{{Soul Magic|b}}
Flash
If all your Spirits/Nexuses have the "EX-AID" family, target an opposing Cost 3 or less Spirit. Destroy it. For each Spirit/Nexus you control, the target cost gets +1.

{{Soul Magic|r}}
Flash
Target an opposing 7000 BP or less Spirit. Destroy it. If your Life was reduced during this turn, the targeting BP becomes 10000 instead.

{{Soul Magic|p||If you control any Purple symbol, you can use it with just the .}}
Flash
Target an opposing Spirit. Send two cores from it to the Reserve. (The opponent chooses which cores to send)

{{Soul Magic|g}}
Flash
Target an opposing Spirit. Heavy exhaust it.

{{Soul Magic|w}}
Flash
Target an opposing Spirit. During this turn, your Life can't be reduced by its attack. If your Life was reduced during this turn, change to target two instead.

{{Soul Magic|y}}
Flash
Target an opposing Spirit. During this turn, give it -2000 BP. Then, destroy it if it's 0 BP. These happen three times.

{{Soul Magic|b}}
Flash
Target an opposing Cost 4 or below Spirit. Destroy it. When choosing the target, you can target one of your Nexuses. Destroy it. For each cost of the Nexus destroyed, the target cost increases by +1 instead.

{{Soul Magic|p||If you control any Purple symbol, you can use it with just the .}}
Flash
Target one of your "ZEZTZ" family Spirits. During this battle, give it +3000 BP. Then, if it has Form Change, draw a card.
